<title>UK: Buyers sidelined on UK meals as prices tumble.</title>
<headline>Buyers sidelined on UK meals as prices tumble.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buyers on the UK meals and feeds market were mostly sidelined on Tuesday as prices tumbled in Chicago and on the home market.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal was as much as five stg down following the shakeout in Chicago.</p>
<p>&quot;Buyers can see the market falling quite sharply and they won't make a move just yet,&quot; said a trader.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
